OL,3,APolice hold press conference in search
OL,4,Afor girl, 13, missing for six days
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a 13-year-old girl who
OL,7,Fhas been missing from home for six days
OL,8,Fhas made an emotional plea for her safe
OL,9,Freturn.
OL,11,FLillia, from Bolton, Greater
OL,12,FManchester, was last seen on Saturday
OL,13,Fat the Trafford Centre shopping mall
OL,14,Fwearing a small black backpack.
OL,16,FPolice said they believe she then
OL,17,Fboarded a bus to nearby Altrincham at
OL,18,Fabout 13:50 BST, but it is not known
OL,19,Fwhere she got off.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
