OL,3,APolice hold press conference in search
OL,4,Afor girl, 13, missing for six days
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement read out by an officer
OL,7,Fduring a police press conference
OL,8,Fearlier, her mother Jessica said: "Lil,
OL,9,FI love you so much. My heart is
OL,10,Fbreaking without you here. I need to
OL,11,Fknow you are safe. We all need you back
OL,12,Fhome safe and well."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
